<title>JAPAN: Onward Kashiyama names new president.</title>
<headline>Onward Kashiyama names new president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onward Kashiyama Co Ltd said on Monday that senior managing director Takeshi Hirouchi would become the company's president on March 1.</p>
<p>Current Onward president Akira Baba will become chairman, Onward said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company, which makes men's ready-made suits, said it hoped the appointment of a new president would help to invigorate its management as it seeks to meet the challenges of the fashion industry.</p>
</text>
